# Line endings are decided here, not by each machine's `core.autocrlf`.
#
# Every text file is stored LF in the repository and checked out LF. Without this,
# the stored form depends on whoever committed it: a contributor with `core.autocrlf`
# unset commits CRLF, and every later diff reads as a whole-file rewrite.
#
# Adding this changed nothing at the time it landed — the index was already LF and
# `git add --renormalize .` produced no diff. It is here to keep that true.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never normalize, never diff as text.
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
